<!--     <!-\-   The collection of intervals <m>(a_n,b_n)</m> with <m>S\subset -\-> -->
<!--     <!-\-   \bigcup^{\infty }_{n=1}{\left(a_n,\ b_n\right)}</m> is called -\-> -->
