<!--     <!-\-   measure of a set to be the infimum of the sums <m>\sum^{\infty -\-> -->
<!--     <!-\-   }_{n=1}{\left(b_n-a_n\right)}</m> over all such open covers. -\-> -->
<!--     <!-\-   In symbols, the (outer) measure of a set <m>S</m> -\-> -->
